WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.880
Demoted from office, Wang Yangming shouldered his bundle and walked toward distant Longchang in Guizhou.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:11.000
The mountain road twisted and turned; he walked slowly, step by step, but never stopped.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.120
The Longchang post station was very simple and crude, surrounded by green mountains and clear streams.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:20.680
Though the little house was crude, it sheltered him from wind and rain, and he settled in with peace of mind.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:25.920
Though life was hard, he worked by day and sat quietly at night reflecting on life.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:30.800
By day he helped with work at the station and became good friends with the local people.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:36.200
Reading and reflecting beside a stone cave, he pondered the principles of Confucianism again and again.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:41.200
As the bamboo grove rustled in the wind, he closed his eyes and thought quietly.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:46.240
Suddenly everything became clear to him — this was the famous Enlightenment at Longchang.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:51.520
He taught that the mind is principle itself, and the unity of knowledge and action, influencing countless scholars of later generations.

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:55.880
His students sat around him under a tree, listening earnestly as he shared the principles in his heart.
